  description: "Each time an effect of a \"Symphonic Warrior\" card is activated,
    place 1 Symphonic Counter on this card when that effect resolves. All \"Symphonic
    Warrior\" monsters on the field gain 100 ATK for each Symphonic Counter on this
    card. Once per turn: You can remove 5 or 7 Symphonic Counters from your field;
    apply this effect, depending on the number of Symphonic Counters removed.\r\n\u25CF
    5 Counters: Inflict 300 damage to your opponent for each \"Symphonic Warrior\"
    card on the field.\r\n\u25CF 7 Counters: Banish cards your opponent controls
    and/or in their Graveyard, up to the number of \"Symphonic Warrior\" cards on
    the field."
